WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.173
Kadison–Ringrose cohomology.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.653
Degree one was known: every derivation is inner.

3
00:00:05.653 --> 00:00:08.149
Higher degrees were open for some factors.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:13.952
Uniform matrix estimates, like those solving similarity, tame every bounded cocycle.

5
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.979
Claimed: it vanishes in every degree from two.

6
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.259
Lean-checked main theorem.
